{%- comment -%}
	GENERATED FILE. Do not edit by hand.

	Affiliate agreement, version 2.0. Written by scripts/build-agreement.mjs in the
	affiliate script repo (c:\code\aira-athletes) from agreement/2.0.json. The same
	file feeds the script that makes the signed PDF, so the page and the PDF
	always carry the same words. To change the wording: tell Tom first, add a
	new version file there, run `npm run agreement`, and commit both repos.

	English only (Tom, November 2026), so the caller puts it in a dir="ltr"
	lang="en" island. That is also why the words are not in the locale files.

	Parameters:
	  card_class     classes of one white card
	  heading_class  classes of a card heading
	  part           'closing' prints only the closing line (top of the Sign card)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if part == 'closing' -%}
